### Expected behavior

View should jump from full-image view, to full-height view, to 1:1 pixel ratio view,  no matter what the x/y pixel size of the photo is.

### Actual behavior

When the x/y pixel size of the image is smaller than the pixel size of the screen, then the 1:1 zooming is not there, , it only jumps between full-screen and full-height modes.

When the x/y pixel size of the image is larger than the pixel size of the screen, then the 1:1 zooming clearly is available.

